Package: pxCNmap
Type: Package
Title: Pixel-Art Tile-Grid Maps of China's Province-Level Units
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Yu-Sung", "Su", role = c("aut", "cre"),
                  email = "suyusung@tsinghua.edu.cn",
                  comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-5021-8209"))
Description: Draws schematic "tile-grid" (block) maps of China's 34
    province-level administrative units using only base R graphics.  Each
    unit is drawn as a rounded square on a regular grid and positioned so
    that the overall arrangement preserves geographic relationships, which
    makes the maps readable when values are labelled directly on the tiles
    rather than encoded by area.  Tile fill, outline, corner rounding, label
    text, label colour and an optional numeric annotation under each label
    are all configurable, and the result can be written straight to a PNG
    file.
